  <History Date="29-06-26" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Moved white to C-Mix wheel bank so that it appears on the same page on consoles with more than 3 encoders.  Added missing Atlabase ID for HSI mode.  Added product thumbnail." Version="3" />
